---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Is Khao Sok National Park worth visiting?"
  description="Is Khao Sok National Park worth visiting? - Find out more in our FAQs"
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Is Khao Sok National Park worth visiting?"
  heroSubtitle="Khao Sok National Park · Field Answer"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Faq Items", "href": "/faq-items/"}, {"label": "Is Khao Sok National Park Wo...", "href": "/faq-items/is-khao-sok-national-park-worth-visiting/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes! There's always something exciting to discover in Khao Sok. Take in the views of stunning limestone cliffs, cruise around emerald Cheow Larn Lake, and spot thrilling local wildlife like monkeys, lizards, snakes, and even elephants.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Larn Lake</a>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Trekking & Hiking</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
